{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS4h4YULH3RdDbyvhRCp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The second publish crashed because each publish stores its top 3 related stories with a similarity score, and that score is a Python float. DynamoDB, through boto3, refuses floats. The first publish only worked because the table was empty, so there was nothing to score and no float in the item. Every later publish has a score, and even a zero score is `0.0`, so they all fail.\n\n**Fix (`src/app.py`):**\n- A new `to_dynamo()` function runs on the whole item just before `put_item` and turns every float, at any depth, into a `Decimal`. Because it covers the whole item, a float added later can't cause the same crash.\n- The conversion goes through `str()` first. Converting a float straight to `Decimal` gives about 55 digits; DynamoDB allows 38, so boto3 rejects it with an `Inexact` error. I confirmed both against the installed boto3.\n- Scores stay on their 0–1 scale, so anything reading them sees the same values as before.\n\n**Tests (`tests/test_publish.py`):** I added three tests:\n- two publishes in a row, both expected to return 201;\n- a publish into a table that already holds five stories;\n- a direct check that `to_dynamo()` converts nested floats exactly.\n\nWith the old code the new tests fail; with the fix all 4 pass.\n\n**Colleague's note:** the cause matched, and so did the lesson about testing against a table that already has data. I changed one thing: they switched scores to whole-number percentages, but I used `Decimal` so the stored values keep the same meaning. I didn't do their \"publish twice against a real table\" step, because you said not to touch outside services.\n\nThe full explanation is in `ANSWER.md`. Nothing is committed yet."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1339,"cache_read_input_tokens":27364,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1339},"output_tokens":555,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0886812a-a45a-4560-88bd-e85a4ed30759","uuid":"5d3cb421-f1a3-446b-a9f2-f3675a891890","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:53:16.883Z","request_id":"req_011CgS4h4G7K6YMYMKiXms9N"}
